  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integration and reconstruction in central Bosnia for 1999-2000. The aim is to reconstruct villages for returning minorities. The activities include reconstruction of houses and of surrounding infrastructure. Implementing counterpart is PMU (CRI). Total Sida contribution amounts to SEK 7 438 000.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xC5;teruppbyggnadsprojekt i centrala Bosnien 1999-2000. M&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att &#xE5;teruppr&#xE4;tta byar och samh&#xE4;llen s&#xE4;rskilt f&#xF6;r &#xE5;terv&#xE4;ndande &quot;minoriteter&quot;. Aktiviteterna inkluderar husreparationer och  reparationer av tillh&#xF6;rande infrastruktur. Genomf&#xF6;rande part &#xE4;r PMU (CRI). Totalt st&#xF6;d f&#xF6;r 10 m&#xE5;nader &#xE4;r SEK 7 438 000.</narrative>
  </description>
